<title>UK: WestHyp sets one billion mark six-year bond.</title>
<headline>WestHyp sets one billion mark six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, ABN AMRO Hoare</p>
<p>Govett, Bayerishe Hypothekenund Wechsel-Bank and Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DIE WESTHYP</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    17.JAN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.215    PAY DATE    17.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  27.5 BP   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6.0	 SELL CONC  21.5	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF EMISSION 3785</p>
</text>
